---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Disclosures & Disclaimers - Costa Ledger">
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 py-16 flex-grow w-full">
    
    <!-- HEADER -->
    <div class="mb-10 border-b border-[#E5E4DF] pb-6">
      <span class="bg-[#07182D] text-[#F9F9F6] text-[9px] font-bold tracking-widest uppercase px-2.5 py-1 mb-4 inline-block">
        LEGAL COMPLIANCE
      </span>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#121212] mb-3">
        Regulatory Disclaimer & Commercial Disclosures
      </h1>
      <div class="text-xs text-[#666666] space-y-1 font-sans">
        <p><strong>Publisher:</strong> MGO Asset Holdings LLC (Fort Lauderdale, Florida, USA).</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- DOCUMENT CONTENT -->
    <div class="prose max-w-none text-sm text-[#2A2E33] leading-relaxed space-y-6">
      
      <!-- SECTION A -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-[#121212] mb-2">Section A: Regulatory & Market Disclaimer</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          Costa Ledger is an independent market intelligence platform and editorial publisher operated by MGO Asset Holdings LLC. Content published across our website, briefings, and special reports is provided strictly for educational and informational purposes.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>No Investment or Financial Advice:</strong> Costa Ledger is not a registered investment advisor with the US Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC), the UK Financial Conduct Authority (FCA), or European financial regulators. Market data, yield estimates, and financial projections do not constitute investment advice or financial promotion.</li>
          <li><strong>No Legal or Tax Advice:</strong> Legal commentary (including Beckham Law, Golden Visas, Digital Nomad Visas, and Gibraltar Category 2 status) represents general editorial interpretation. Readers must consult certified local lawyers and tax advisors prior to executing transactions.</li>
          <li><strong>Independent Due Diligence:</strong> Readers are solely responsible for verifying market data and performing independent due diligence before committing capital. MGO Asset Holdings LLC accepts no liability for decisions made based on published materials.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- SECTION B -->
      <section class="pt-4 border-t border-[#E5E4DF]">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-[#121212] mb-2">Section B: Commercial Transparency & FTC Disclosure</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          In compliance with Federal Trade Commission (FTC) guidelines and European commercial transparency standards:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Editorial Independence:</strong> Costa Ledger does not accept payment from property developers or agents to alter, prioritize, or bias our market coverage. "Admission is earned, not purchased."</li>
          <li><strong>Referral Fees & Monetization:</strong> MGO Asset Holdings LLC maintains formal, non-exclusive collaboration and referral agreements with vetted execution partners across Southern Europe (including estate agencies, law firms, relocation agencies, and mortgage intermediaries). When you request an introduction or contract services through our platform, MGO Asset Holdings LLC may receive a referral fee or commission upon transaction completion. This fee is paid entirely by the partner or developer from standard commercial margins and incurs zero extra cost to you.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>